{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a town-building, turn-based RPG wrapped in a time travel story where you guide an unlikely group of six to put a ruined timeline on the right track. It's TIME to rebuild!!<br><br>Discover blueprints and use the intuitive Chronorama building system to weave a new fate for everyone! Build houses, trees, rivers to support your diorama-like towns and watch them age between two distinct periods of time. Go back and forth between eras to solve puzzles, discover secrets, and fix the timeline!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1471430?t=1749697975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749697975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749697975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749697975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a town-building, turn-based RPG wrapped in a time travel story where you guide an unlikely group of six to put a ruined timeline on the right track. It's TIME to rebuild!!<br><br>Discover blueprints and use the intuitive Chronorama building system to weave a new fate for everyone! Build houses, trees, rivers to support your diorama-like towns and watch them age between two distinct periods of time. Go back and forth between eras to solve puzzles, discover secrets, and fix the timeline!</p>","developers":["Hopscorch"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"htt